	extends "ABSTRACT SeriesSelection(MenB): Select MenB 4C 2-dose series if dose 1 is (CVX 163, CVX 328), target dose 2 (CVX 163, CVX 328) is Invalid in both 4C 2-dose series/3-dose series"
