/**
 * Sub-bullet 2:
 *   If target dose 1 (CVX 162 [Meningococcal B FHbp, recombinant (Trumenba)]) is Valid for the MenB FHbp 2-dose Series AND Valid
 *   for MenB FHbp 3-dose Series, the MenB FHbp 2-dose series applies.
