	extends "ABSTRACT SeriesSelection(MenB): Select MenB FHbp 2-dose series if dose 1 is (CVX 162, CVX 316); target dose 2 (CVX 162, CVX 316) is Valid in FHbp 2-dose series"
	dialect "mvel"
